    "body": "I think we need to add a new concept in the WebSocket API spec similar to https://websockets.spec.whatwg.org/#make-disappear but that calls \"fail the WebSocket connection\" in the second condition. (Otherwise we would call \"fail the websocket connection\" also when the closing handshake has already started or when connection is already closed.)\n\nAlso, use `<span>` for cross-references. New terms from other specs need to be listed in the Dependencies section.",
